	(text "PB15 = pin 36 (CC2); pin 63 is VSS.\nKB_IRQ PA0/WKUP1; gauge PC13/WKUP2.\nCHG_INT PC2, TCPP_FLT PC3, DISP_IRQ PB12: distinct EXTI lines.\nVBAT uses regulated 3V3, never the raw 4.2V cell.\nOnly R13/R14 pull up the shared I2C bus."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 208.28 170.18 0)
